;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "僕らの日常.ogg" "BGM2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM2" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\女ケ沢市全景.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物3,人物1" "2" "500" "960" "1" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"It's almost lunchtime. Breakfast was just whatever, so isn't there a nice restaurant somewhere?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... If there's a good place on the way to the cable car, let's stop in."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\中華レストラン.gal" "NORMAL" "2" "500" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">We went into a random Chinese restaurant on the way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was lunchtime, but there weren't many tourists to be seen.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Lots of the customers were in casual clothes, and the prices were reasonable.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, doesn't this restaurant have Russian-roulette takoyaki?" [TN: takoyaki: fried batter balls with octopus inside]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... let's not do that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Sounds fun! Looks like they've got Russian-roulette pork buns.
{PAUSE ""}
　One time <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> and I had a showdown with wasabi in daifuku." [TN: daifuku: soft rice cake with a sweet filling]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">So it really was </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="2">'s upbringing behind this...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜びバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Excuse meee!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Three </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ジエモシエンパオズ">jiemo xian baozi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> (mustard-filled pork buns), with one hit, please!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　And add </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="ホアジャオ">huajiao</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> (Japanese pepper berries) to the hit one!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh my, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">little miss</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Your Chinese is very good!" [TN: he ends with 'aru,' a stock pseudo-Chinese speech tic.]</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Why can </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> read advanced kanji only at times like this!?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\運転席昼.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "2" "500" "960" "1" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">After lunch, we turned onto a road with few buildings.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If we kept on it for a while, we would apparently reach the mountain with the cable car.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, maybe because she'd gotten so excited at the zoo, fell asleep once lunch was over.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>... do you have enough water?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll buy more at the next convenience store..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It wasn't as bad as the black one at Zahha, but that one just now was pretty intense too...</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "226" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\ゴンドラ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "2" "500" "960" "1" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜び.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Wow! Cable cars are amazing!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s house is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Ha! It must be over there!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">In the cable car, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was as excited as ever.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> may have been why: after seeing her, she was full of energy even with the cherry blossoms in full bloom.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe because the sun was starting to go down, the cable car wasn't very crowded.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It's not even a ski resort, and they have something like this. Megasawa must really put effort into tourism too.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">What would have happened if we had caused the incident?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If it had become a perfect crime, it might have gotten a name like the Megasawa case, and tourists might have stopped coming.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Of everything in there, what bothered me most was that drug.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I've never heard of a drug that draws out 100% of a person's strength.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">For that matter, I can't believe a drug like that could be used without paying some price.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I looked at my watch. It was almost 17:00.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The time set for it had already passed. The incident would never happen now.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This, too, was because </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> had shown us </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s true heart.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">And </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... it's thanks to </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> giving </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> strength.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would never want anyone killed.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Today is the anniversary of </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> death. Rest in peace.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Even so, my tongue was still burning...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM2" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\女ケ沢夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">As expected, the wind was strong at the summit.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The weather was nice and the sunset was beautiful, but it was hard to keep my eyes open.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供喜び.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Amazing, amazing! You can't see anything like this in Motoki-cho!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was excited despite the strong wind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Did she have no premonition at all?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE>, I'm going to go throw out the trash."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sure. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, let me pick you up. You'll see better that way, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s face was lit brilliantly by the setting sun.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">To tell the truth, something was bothering me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was the reason we had seen </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s true heart. That much was certain.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But... had </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> really come along just for that?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">We might have seen that kind of face on </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> through some other trigger, too.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Or if </STYLE>Akane<STYLE ID="2"> had tried harder to persuade her, it might have turned out the same.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It was all ifs and maybes, but it just didn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ふ">sit</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> right with me, and my unease was growing little by little.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If we hadn't correctly understood the reason </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> came along...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">No, I should stop thinking about it. We no longer had to kill anyone.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But... how was I supposed to explain this situation to </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wouldn't be convinced by 'It was written on your face.'</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe tell her we had caused the incident, and head straight back to Motoki-cho.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No... then the bullying of </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> wouldn't stop.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="10">Besides, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s 'someone I can trust' would come after us.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But did that person really exist?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Maybe it was just a desperate lie from </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Could it be that </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Mifuyu-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> sent us that letter herself?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If so, she would have just met us instead of doing something so roundabout.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, with wording like that, she could lure us to Megasawa.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Damn...! My reasoning just couldn't keep up...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But at the very least, something didn't seem to fit...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, I think she said something about a religious group...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
